:: Vanilla Waiting Room
Welcome to Degrees of Lewdity X-Change <<- StartConfig.version>><<if StartConfig.versionName>> <<print StartConfig.versionName>><</if>>!
<br><br>
It seems you're transferring a save from Vanilla <<- $saveVersions.last()>> to DoLX. <span class="gold">Please check your game settings in a safe room like your bedroom to check Modded Settings!</span> Not doing this will result in you missing out on 99% of DoLX's content! DoLX is built on top of DoLP, with the idea of player Sex change and Gender Identity so nearly everything is a setting the player can change.
<br><br>
<<if $passagePrev is "Settings">><<set $passagePrev to $passagePrevv>><<unset $passagePrevv>><</if>>
<<link [[확인|$passagePrev]]>><<doVersionCheck>><</link>>
<br>
<span class="red">Transferring your save from Vanilla to Modded is fine but Modded to Vanilla or Modded to Modded is almost always going to cause issues. <b>And herm/sex+gender state from another build not supported for DoLX</b>.</span>
